  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 302.07 “Independent System Operator for New England” (ISO-NE) means the administrator or operator for New England’s bulk power system or any successor system as named by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC).\n\nSource. #8448, eff 10-18-05; ss by #10603, eff 5-21-14; ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (formerly Puc 302.11) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
